## Schedule 
Jiangjunshan, Niushoushan.

## Daily
Morning, we got up at about 8:00am, then we went ahead, we took the rail way to Linchang, and the car we took from Chahe to Linchang need to give a signal of five fingers. Then we took the S3 at the NanjingNan station. When we took the train we met a lot cosers there was Nioor in the game Nioor and the machine centery. Then we got the mountain. Before we went to the mountain, we went to buy some foods at the 7/11 store where reminds me of the school days. Then we went to the montain. We walked through the mountain, I found that there was some bambooes besides the way, and we got some, On the road, we met a little snake and the Quancai. CHN sended me a little story, and we talked a little...Bitch.
We got a big one behind the temple, there was a beauty with a ugly man... Then we went through the lake with shabby play park. The lake and the YUefei temple. We walked through a big cemetery. Then we got NIushoushan, the road towards the head of the mountain, and I felt really hard while Wuxiaodao go ahead, we met a couple on the mountain and they said we should cross the wire netting, then we finally got the temple... Fuck I crash my camera again of the 70-200...
The temple was wanderful. We went back with two girls from Zhongmou Zhengzhou on a taxi, they are students...
Then we ate the soup and walked a lot at Fuzimiao...
We went back by the train, there was a girl on the train, really like Liyuan with thick lip, she got off at Dongnan university Chengxian college. The moment she got off, I really hope if I can return back to the school...
When we got the Chahe, the train was run out of time, then we walked a lot and the call the taxi...

PS:The story CHN told me and the talk she made as follw, and the Bamboo was really big.
